{"type":"message","id":"c173c30f","parentId":"b53c51a0","timestamp":"2026-03-17T23:59:38.821Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"发现 `web_search` 工具需要 Brave Search API Key 才能使用。让我尝试使用 Tavily 搜索工具 `tavily-search` 技能来完成任务。","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"read:7","name":"read","arguments":{"path":"~/.openclaw/skills/tavily-search/SKILL.md"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"web_fetch:8","name":"web_fetch","arguments":{"url":"https://www.eastmoney.com/a/202603183001234567.html"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"web_fetch:9","name":"web_fetch","arguments":{"url":"https://finance.sina.com.cn/stock/roll/2026-03-18/doc-inaaaaaa1234567.shtml"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"web_fetch:10","name":"web_fetch","arguments":{"url":"https://www.cnbc.com/world/"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"web_fetch:11","name":"web_fetch","arguments":{"url":"https://www.reuters.com/world/"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"volcengine-plan","model":"kimi-k2.5","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1773791969656}}
{"type":"message","id":"c57f7ed7","parentId":"c173c30f","timestamp":"2026-03-17T23:59:38.834Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"read:7","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"---\nname: tavily-search\ndescription: Tavily专业搜索引擎集成，提供高质量的网页搜索、新闻搜索、学术搜索功能。支持深度搜索、结果摘要、来源引用。当用户需要搜索最新信息、事实核查、查找资料时使用。\n---\n\n# Tavily Search 搜索引擎技能\n\n## 核心功能\n- 🔍 **网页搜索**：高质量全网搜索，返回最新、最相关的结果\n- 📰 **新闻搜索**：专门搜索最新新闻资讯，支持按时间范围过滤\n- 🎓 **学术搜索**：搜索学术论文、研究报告、专业资料\n- 📝 **智能摘要**：自动生成搜索结果的摘要，节省阅读时间\n- 📌 **来源引用**：所有结果都带原始来源链接，方便核实\n- 🌍 **多语言支持**：支持中英等多种语言搜索\n\n## 配置方法\n在配置文件中添加你的Tavily API Key：\n```yaml\ntavily:\n  api_key: \"your-tavily-api-key\"\n  max_results: 5  # 默认返回结果数量\n  search_depth: \"basic\"  # basic/advanced\n```\n\n## 使用示例\n```python\nfrom tavily import TavilyClient\ntavily = TavilyClient(api_key=\"your-api-key\")\nresponse = tavily.search(\"最新的AI技术发展趋势\", search_depth=\"advanced\")\nprint(response['answer'])  # 自动生成的摘要答案\nprint(response['results']) # 详细搜索结果列表\n```\n\n## 触发场景\n- 用户需要搜索最新的信息、新闻、资料\n- 需要事实核查、验证信息准确性\n- 查找专业知识、学术论文、技术文档\n- 需要获取带来源引用的可靠信息\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1773791978832}}
